            <div xml:id="d81">

                <pb facs="0153" n="119" sameAs="frus:frus1870/pg119"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">No. 81.</note>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[By cable.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. E. B. Washburne to Mr. Fish.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1870-09-12"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >September</hi> 12, 1870</date>. (Received September 12,
                        1870.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Government requests me to use my good offices, unofficially, and simply as a
                    citizen, to hold intercourse with Prussian government. Have declined until I can
                    hear from you. Immediate answer important.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WASHBURNE.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
